         *
         * > The frameset-ok flag is set to "ok" when the parser is created. It is set to "not ok" after certain tokens are seen.
         *
         * @since 6.4.0
         *
         * @see https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#frameset-ok-flag
         *
         * @var bool
         */
