         *
         * [--format=<format>]
         * : Render output in a particular format.
         * ---
         * options:
         *   - table
         *   - csv
         *   - json
         *   - yaml
         * ---
         *
         * [--scope=<scope>]
         * : Can be all, global, ms_global, blog, or old tables. Defaults to all.
         *
         * [--network]
