         *     | wp_links              | 32 KB |
         *     | wp_options            | 32 KB |
         *     | wp_postmeta           | 48 KB |
         *     | wp_terms              | 48 KB |
         *     | wp_term_taxonomy      | 48 KB |
         *     | wp_term_relationships | 32 KB |
